-StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ 주요골자</span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 34.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -39.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">파워엘리트장학금 및 성적오름장학금 신설에 따른 장학생 선발 및 지급기준을</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 설정함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 장학생 선발 성적기준을 상향 조정함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 봉사장학금에서 학생자치단체장학금을 분리 신설함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 사회봉사장학금을 봉사장학금으로 통합함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">스마일장</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">학금의 지급 범위를 확대함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 등록금 총액의 범위 안에서 장학금 중복 수혜를 허용함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 기타 용어 및 항목 순서를 정비함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ 시행일자 :&nbsp;<!--